      "cooked": "<p><font face=\"UICTFontTextStyleTallBody\"><span>In regards to the SotM Kickstarter fulfillment;&nbsp;</span></font><span>I have not been notified of shipment but checking my KS survey (from 15 months ago), I find it still indicates my old CA address. I live in FL now.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font face=\"UICTFontTextStyleTallBody\"><span>KS indicates the address is \"locked for shipping?\"</span></font><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><br><span>Can &gt;G please confirm where the shipment is going?</span><br><br><span>The correct address is in Tampa, FL. The incorrect address is in La Mesa, CA.</span><br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
