      "raw": "<p>Emails are in backlog, because everyone is in the warehouse shipping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Per the latest kickstarter update if you sent them an email before the 21st of July, it -should- be properly updated. If it isnt, and you did send an email, theyll cover the mistake and correct it as soon as they can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you didn&#39;t, they can ship you another one once your old one comes back as undeliverable, but you&#39;ll have to cover shipping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your best bet is to contact FedEx, explain that you are expecting a package and it may be getting shipped to your old address. They can look up through the address+your name, and then, assuming it hasn&#39;t been shipped yet, put a notice on it to re-lable it to another address. It will be a small charge, but you&#39;re far more likely to get it done and fixed this way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are quick and they haven&#39;t shipped it out at all yet, you should be really luckly. If they have shipped it that charge may be a bit more than small, to move that package back across the country :/</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Otherwise, your only bet is to wait and see.</p>",
